IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BGLBLK.

*> Reusable reservation primitive on the account balance.
*> Adjusts BAL-BLOCKED (a temporary reservation) and keeps the invariant
*> available = ledger - blocked.  It never changes BAL-LEDGER, so a block is
*> NOT a final debit; releasing or consuming the block restores the funds.
*> Used by the MED hold manager.  Refuses a block that would push available
*> below zero, which keeps "returned <= available" enforceable at the source.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT BAL-FILE ASSIGN TO WS-BAL-PATH
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS BAL-ACCT-ID
        FILE STATUS IS WS-BAL-ST.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD BAL-FILE.
01 BAL-REC.
   05 BAL-ACCT-ID PIC X(12).
   05 BAL-LEDGER PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-AVAILABLE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-BLOCKED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
   05 BAL-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 BAL-UPDATED PIC 9(08).
   05 BAL-SEQ PIC 9(12).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-BAL-PATH PIC X(200).
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 WS-BAL-ST PIC X(02).
01 WS-CFG.
   05 WS-HOME-CFG PIC X(80).
   05 WS-BIZDATE PIC 9(08).
   05 WS-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
   05 WS-JRN-GEN PIC 9(09).
   05 WS-CFG-ST PIC X(02).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-BLK-ACCT PIC X(12).
01 LS-BLK-CURRENCY PIC X(03).
01 LS-BLK-DELTA PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 LS-BLK-BLOCKED PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 LS-BLK-AVAILABLE PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 LS-BLK-LEDGER PIC S9(15)V99 COMP-3.
01 LS-BLK-RC PIC X(02).
01 LS-BLK-MSG PIC X(80).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LS-BLK-ACCT LS-BLK-CURRENCY LS-BLK-DELTA
    LS-BLK-BLOCKED LS-BLK-AVAILABLE LS-BLK-LEDGER LS-BLK-RC LS-BLK-MSG.
    MOVE "00" TO LS-BLK-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-BLK-MSG
    MOVE 0 TO LS-BLK-BLOCKED LS-BLK-AVAILABLE LS-BLK-LEDGER
    CALL "BCFG" USING WS-CFG
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-BAL-PATH
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-HOME) "/var/data/acctbal.idx"
        DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-BAL-PATH
    OPEN I-O BAL-FILE
    IF WS-BAL-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE "20" TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "BALANCE STORE UNAVAILABLE" TO LS-BLK-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    MOVE LS-BLK-ACCT TO BAL-ACCT-ID
    READ BAL-FILE
    IF WS-BAL-ST = "23"
        MOVE "23" TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "BALANCE NOT FOUND" TO LS-BLK-MSG
        CLOSE BAL-FILE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    IF LS-BLK-CURRENCY NOT = SPACES AND
       LS-BLK-CURRENCY NOT = BAL-CURRENCY
        MOVE "20" TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "CURRENCY MISMATCH" TO LS-BLK-MSG
        CLOSE BAL-FILE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    ADD LS-BLK-DELTA TO BAL-BLOCKED
    IF BAL-BLOCKED < 0
        SUBTRACT LS-BLK-DELTA FROM BAL-BLOCKED
        MOVE "20" TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "BLOCK UNDERFLOWS RESERVATION" TO LS-BLK-MSG
        CLOSE BAL-FILE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE LS-BLK-AVAILABLE = BAL-LEDGER - BAL-BLOCKED
    IF LS-BLK-AVAILABLE < 0
        SUBTRACT LS-BLK-DELTA FROM BAL-BLOCKED
        MOVE "20" TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "INSUFFICIENT FUNDS TO BLOCK" TO LS-BLK-MSG
        CLOSE BAL-FILE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE BAL-AVAILABLE = BAL-LEDGER - BAL-BLOCKED
    MOVE BAL-AVAILABLE TO LS-BLK-AVAILABLE
    MOVE BAL-BLOCKED TO LS-BLK-BLOCKED
    MOVE BAL-LEDGER TO LS-BLK-LEDGER
    MOVE WS-BIZDATE TO BAL-UPDATED
    ADD 1 TO BAL-SEQ
    REWRITE BAL-REC
    IF WS-BAL-ST NOT = "00"
        MOVE WS-BAL-ST TO LS-BLK-RC
        MOVE "BALANCE BLOCK REWRITE ERROR" TO LS-BLK-MSG
    END-IF
    CLOSE BAL-FILE
    GOBACK.
